  "notes": "COMPOUND VERB:\nCombines {掻|か}く (to scrape) + {消|け}す (to erase), creating an image of scraping away or overwhelming something.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSION:\n- {掻|か}き{消|け}すように{消|き}える (to vanish as if erased)\n\nRELATED:\n- {消|け}す (to erase, turn off)\n- {消|き}える (to disappear)",
